    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><p>CSV Import allows the user to migrate the data from one Bahmni implementation to another. This data can consist of predefined types such as Encounter, Patient, Concept, etc.</p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Used By</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Administrator of the hospital uses this feature.</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);font-size: 14.0px;line-height: 1.42857;\">1.&nbsp;Select Admin module from the home dashboard.&nbsp;</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.17.27 pm.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">&nbsp;Home Dashboard</span></strong><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">2. Select CSV Upload</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"500\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.19.13 pm.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Admin Module Options</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">3. Select the type of data (Concept, Encounter, Drug, etc.) you want to upload and choose the file which has the data</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.14.20 pm.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">4. When you upload the file you will see the result in the uploaded files section. The time taken to upload the files&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">depends on the size of the data. Click &quot;Refresh&quot; to see the status of upload.</span></span></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows may not be constant across all installations of Bahmni.</span></strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Data Migration - Import\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Data Migration - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implemnentation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Configure CSV Import\" ri:version-at-save=\"16\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Configure CSV Import - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
