      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ImportData-AbouttheFeature\">About the Feature</h2><p>CSV Import allows the user to migrate the data from one Bahmni implementation to another. This data can consist of predefined types such as Encounter, Patient, Concept, etc.</p><h2 id=\"ImportData-UsedBy\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Used By</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Administrator of the hospital uses this feature.</span></p><h2 id=\"ImportData-HowisitUsed?\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">How is it Used?</span></h2><h2 id=\"ImportData-1.SelectAdminmodulefromthehomedashboard.\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0px;line-height: 1.42857;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">1. Select Admin module from the home dashboard. </span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706473096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=357\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706473096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837905\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.17.27 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"34928d99-07bd-4017-ae69-f8a0b292d8a1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706473096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=714 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.17.27%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706473096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=400&amp;height=357 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> Home Dashboard</span></strong><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">2. Select CSV Upload</span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.19.13%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706575206&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=156\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.19.13%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706575206&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837906\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.19.13 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"09c52905-2027-4008-8a7e-7a2805107e18\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.19.13%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706575206&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=312 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.19.13%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706575206&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=156 1x\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Admin Module Options</span></strong></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">3. Select the type of data (Concept, Encounter, Drug, etc.) you want to upload and choose the file which has the data</span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.14.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706289242&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=79\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.14.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706289242&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53837900\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-04-15 at 1.14.20 pm.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"53313590\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"6\" data-media-id=\"e1e87c9d-ce1c-44fe-a1e8-bcdca8268077\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.14.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706289242&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=158 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/53313590/Screen%20Shot%202016-04-15%20at%201.14.20%20pm.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1460706289242&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=79 1x\"></span></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">4. When you upload the file you will see the result in the uploaded files section. The time taken to upload the files </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">depends on the size of the data. Click &quot;Refresh&quot; to see the status of upload.</span></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6462b5e2-1d86-451d-a8c5-c39c2f99335c\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><strong><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni configuration for each implementation can vary drastically. The screens and workflows may not be constant across all installations of Bahmni.</span></strong></p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/53313592/Data+Migration+-+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"53313592\" data-linked-resource-version=\"11\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Data Migration - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Implemnentation Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/18415806/Configure+CSV+Import\" data-linked-resource-id=\"18415806\" data-linked-resource-version=\"17\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure CSV Import - Implementer's Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
